Subject: [PATCH 09285/11362] Changelog correction: the anchoring claim's
 counterexample was in its own table

The entry stated that a seed helps when nearly right and hurts when nearly
noise, on the strength of tu93 t0. sb26 t0's seed also had recall 0.0 and it
converted to 1.0. Both cells were reported in the same table and the tension
between them was missed, so the record on near-noise seeds is 1 of 2 rather
than a mechanism.

Appended rather than rewritten, per never-prune, and sized honestly: the broad
trigger qualifies 5 cells of which the seeded arm already converted 4, and the
narrow trigger qualifies 2. A paired skip-arm measurement is running to settle
it, because the cross-wave comparison that motivated the lever is the same
confound that produced the marginal-band null already withdrawn in this entry.

